prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Petitioner most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Issue an appropriate writ, order or direction, more particularly a writ in the nature of mandamus, directing the Respondents to {primary_direction};

b) Issue a writ directing constitution of an independent SIT / transfer of investigation to CBI in respect of {incident_brief};

c) Direct the Respondents to pay compensation of Rs. {compensation_amount} for the violation of fundamental rights of the Petitioner / victim;

d) Direct disciplinary action against the erring officials, namely {officials_named};

e) Pending hearing and final disposal of this petition, grant such interim protection / direction as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit;

f) Award costs of this petition; and

g) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Petitioner shall ever pray.
